"k": "4955",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_fabletownwoodlandbuilding",
"en": "[pickup2]I found a plastic bag, with blood in it.  And over there, an imprint of a woman's shoes.  So I gotta ask... I know you like to shop..."
