"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_fabletownwoodlandbuilding",
"en": "[pickup2]The imprints in the mud, near the flower bushes.  Someone stood there a long time watching.  Then they walked forward, catching a petal on their clothes.  Then, as they lay her head on the steps, it dropped where I found it."
